Licensing scope
===============

The MIT license below covers original Modular AI Robotics source code,
documentation, build tools, tests, schemas, functional data definitions and
example scripts or behavior packs.

Original artwork, robot models, textures, icons, sounds and logo artwork are
excluded from this MIT grant and are governed by ASSET_LICENSE.md. Their paths
and credits must be recorded in the reserved-asset inventory in
docs/licensing.md. A file is not a reserved asset merely because it is inside
a Minecraft assets directory.

Third-party material remains subject to its own applicable terms and notices.
Contributors retain copyright in material they own; this notice does not
transfer their ownership to the project maintainer.

